OL,3,GNEWSAArson arrest after house fire left
OL,4,Atwo in hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Farson with intent to endanger life
OL,8,Fafter a house fire which left two
OL,9,Fpeople in hospital.
OL,11,FTwo women sustained minor injuries
OL,12,Fduring a fire at a property on Greenlee
OL,13,FGarth in Newton Aycliffe in the early
OL,14,Fhours of Wednesday morning. They have
OL,15,Fsince been discharged from Darlington
OL,16,FMemorial Hospital.
OL,18,FDurham Police said no-one else was
OL,19,Finjured but neighbouring houses were
OL,20,Fdamaged.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
